an obligation can start on day a day if
    the contract the annual return obligation starts on day the day with charity a charity.

the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges the_charity to file the annual return by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the contract the annual return obligation starts on day N with charity a charity
    and the charity status of the charity is a value
    and the value is equal to active
    and D = N + 60.

the contract is fulfilled if
    the contract the annual return obligation starts on day a day with charity a charity
    and the charity status of the charity is a value
    and it is not the case that the value is equal to active.

the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to file the annual return by day a due day D as its first obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does file the annual return on day N
    and the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges the party to file the annual return by day D as its first obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and N <= D.

the contract is fulfilled if
    the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to file the annual return by day a due day as its first obligation ends on day a day
    and the party does file the annual return on day the day.

the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges the_commissioner to issue a required steps notice by day a due day D as its second obligation starts on day a day N if
    the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to file the annual return by day a second due day as its first obligation is missed on day N
    and D = N + 14.

the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to file the annual return by day a due day as its first obligation has deadline day the due day if
    the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges the party to file the annual return by day the due day as its first obligation starts on day a day.

the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to issue a required steps notice by day a due day D as its second obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does issue a required steps notice on day N
    and the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges the party to issue a required steps notice by day D as its second obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and N <= D.

the obligation that the correction period obliges the_charity to correct the deficiencies by day a due day D as its first obligation starts on day a day N if
    the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to issue a required steps notice by day a second due day as its second obligation ends on day N
    and the party does issue a required steps notice on day N
    and D = N + 30.

the contract is breached by the_commissioner because "failed to issue notice" if
    the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to issue a required steps notice by day a due day as its second obligation is missed on day a day.

the obligation that the annual return obligation obliges a party to issue a required steps notice by day a due day as its second obligation has deadline day the due day if
